# Sprint report archive
#
# This directory holds sprint reports that the Dispatch orchestrator has
# consumed (read + cross-referenced against kanban + git state). The
# orchestrator MOVES reports from .claude/sprint-reports/ into this directory
# once verification passes. Reports are NEVER deleted; they have long-term
# reference value and this archive is the permanent record of every sprint
# the orchestrator has consumed.
#
# The launcher in Dev Window v2 (devtools/dev-window-v2/dev-window-v2.ps1
# Ensure-CliSprintReportDirs) creates this directory on startup so the layout
# is correct on a fresh checkout even before any reports have been archived.
#
# See: context/designs/devwindow-claude-cli-panel.md, "Sprint report
# consumption protocol (orchestrator contract)".
